releaseNotes:
We made a few things easier:

- your days now add up instead of resetting. Missing a day is okay;
- the keyboard in notes no longer keeps you waiting;
- search now shows cover art;
- long-press a card in the library to save it;
- and a few small things that annoyed us more than you.

More to come. Thanks for being here.

Major Update:

- New recipe page. Over 200 recipes;
- Cholesterol and saturated fat tracking;
- AI-powered body fat scan;
- New progress page: weight trends, calorie trends, nutrient changes, analytics on sugar and water intake, and step count;
- Calmetry AI chat update;
- Series of meal-adding days;
- Notes added to the home screen;
- Support for new languages added to the app.

We made Just Weight even easier to use:

• added separate settings for weigh-in reminders, motivational messages, and important push notifications;
• motivational messages now appear reliably after logging your weight and are available offline;
• made transitions between sections smoother;
• reviewed and improved all 13 translations;
• fixed bugs and improved app stability.

Added premium features:
- advanced statistics;
- comparison of periods;
- filtering by goals in the calendar and on the statistics screen; 
- different color design; 
- automatic backup; 
- protection of the application login with a PIN code.

Update v1.0.2:

- Updated tutorial;
- Fix bugs.

We heard your feedback and made Stats easier and more familiar to use.

In this update:
• the latest events appear at the top of History;
• you can quickly switch between day and week views;
• you can view charts and numbers for a selected tracker in the same tab;
• we added new settings for trackers on your Lock Screen;
• dates and times now adapt to your language, region, and system format;
• we fixed blank widgets and a few other issues that could get in the way of everyday parenting.

Thank you for helping us make Sprouty work better for real family life.

- Цифровые финансовые активы (ЦФА) теперь в приложении. В скринере появился отдельный раздел ЦФА для быстрого поиска и сравнения выпусков;
- Фьючерсы в скринере. Анализируйте контракты наравне с акциями и облигациями. Настраивайте персональные фильтры, сохраняйте их в один клик, пользуйтесь готовыми стратегиями и делитесь подборками с коллегами;
- В облигациях появился раздел «Кредитный рейтинг». Рейтинги эмитентов теперь отображаются на дашборде и в карточках облигаций, а подписка на уведомления вовремя предупредит вас об их изменениях по эмитенту и по выпуску облигаций;
- Приватность и защита данных в портфелях. Просматривайте портфель в публичных местах, не раскрывая размер капитала. Нажмите на «глаз», чтобы размыть суммы и цены в портфелях.

We've taken your feedback into account, in the new version we added:
- support for iOS 14 and above;
- English localization;
- possibility to subscribe to the air raid alert notifications (you can subscribe to several regions at once).

Welcome to the new App version!

Changes: 
• Returning to the original App icon;
• Small improvements and bug fixes;

Thanks for your feedback and reviews: this way, you help us evolve and grow!

Meet the completely redesigned Drink Water interface!

• modern design and intuitive navigation;
• redesigned Home, Statistics, Weight Tracker and Settings;
• improved water reminders;
• bug fixes and stability improvements.

We’d be very grateful if you rated the app and left a review — it helps us keep improving :-)

Drink water, take care of your health and stay healthy!

